{"2707050": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Chill Out: The Art of Chaos", "steam_appid": 2707050, "required_age": "13", "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In “Chill Out: The Art of Chaos”, players are given the freedom to interact with the environment in a way that’s both satisfying and stress-relieving. You can shoot objects, watching as they shatter and break in a physics-based simulation. The game’s focus is not on aim or strategy, but on the cathartic experience of destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The detailed, realistic graphics of “Chill Out: The Art of Chaos” add to the immersive experience, making players feel like they’re truly part of the world they’re destroying. This game is not just a pastime, but a virtual stress-relief tool that allows players to let go of their worries and immerse themselves in the act of destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Whether you’re feeling stressed or just want to pass the time, “Chill Out: The Art of Chaos” offers a unique gaming experience that’s all about letting loose and enjoying the destruction. So why wait? Start playing “Chill Out: The Art of Chaos” today and discover the joy of interactive relaxation.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In “Chill Out: The Art of Chaos”, players are given the freedom to interact with the environment in a way that’s both satisfying and stress-relieving. You can shoot objects, watching as they shatter and break in a physics-based simulation. The game’s focus is not on aim or strategy, but on the cathartic experience of destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The detailed, realistic graphics of “Chill Out: The Art of Chaos” add to the immersive experience, making players feel like they’re truly part of the world they’re destroying. This game is not just a pastime, but a virtual stress-relief tool that allows players to let go of their worries and immerse themselves in the act of destruction.</p><p